.TH LXCFS "1" "August 2026" "lxcfs "7.0.0"" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lxcfs \- "System virtualization filesystem for containers"
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lxcfs
\fI\,<directory>\/\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
lxcfs is a FUSE\-based proc, sys virtualizing filesystem
.SS "Options :"
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR
Run lxcfs with debugging enabled
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-foreground\fR
Run lxcfs in the foreground
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.HP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-enable\-loadavg\fR Enable loadavg virtualization
.TP
\fB\-o\fR
Options to pass directly through fuse
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-pidfile\fR=\fI\,FILE\/\fR
Path to use for storing lxcfs pid
Default pidfile is \fI\,/run/lxcfs.pid\/\fP
.TP
\fB\-u\fR, \fB\-\-disable\-swap\fR
Disable swap virtualization
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print lxcfs version
.TP
\fB\-\-enable\-cfs\fR
Enable CPU virtualization via CPU shares
.TP
\fB\-\-enable\-pidfd\fR
Use pidfd for process tracking
.TP
\fB\-\-runtime\-dir\fR=\fI\,DIR\/\fR
Path to use as the runtime directory.
Default is \fI\,/run\/\fP
